  PlayerLayer:
    serializedVersion: 2
    m_Bits: 512
  Sentences:
  - Get outta my Sight
  - You cat-licked doo-doo diddler
  - Piss off !
  - Long Live True King Damien !
  - Maybe, Maybe not, Maybe go Fuck yourself.
  - Why so glum ?  Shit your trousers ?
  - Oi, Mate ?
  - Ehh, go gargle your bum.
  - Your mum stincks of porridge
  - Be...gone...
  - You all can kiss me down under
  - Damn. You're Ugly
  - Want to learn a magic trick ? it's called "fuff off."
  - Enjoy livin' freak, while you can.
  - War is coming. I don't know when, I don't know who will be fighting. But it's
    coming.
  - May god grant long long life to King Damien's rule
  - This ale is like shit. Bring me some wine !
  - Ahaaaa, bring me more ale !
  - Rumors say Emir Tahmasb will rise in rebellion...
  - Bjorn is a stupid dumbfuck, I'm glad I live in the south.
  - Ahhh, stinky Northmens..
  Sentence: {fileID: 721122251}
  Sentencebox: {fileID: 1873336619}
